    "description": {
      "value": "Heavenly radiance shines from an active celestial staff, a golden staff capped with a pair of sculpted angel's wings. Used as a weapon, the staff is a staff. While wielding a celestial staff, you gain a +1 circumstance bonus to saving throws against effects that have the evil trait and effects created by evil creatures. When you prepare this staff, if you're evil, you become drained 1 until your next daily preparations. You expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list. divine lance (good only) bless, protection continual flame, inner radiance torrent circle of protection, sanctified ground holy cascade, inner radiance torrent spiritual guardian, summon celestial holy cascade, summon celestial angel form, inner radiance torrent, summon celestial"
